Life left - the countdown app is a set of toolboxes that integrate multiple time functions. It can clearly show how long you have survived in the world, predict how many lives you have left, and visually show you, your family and friends You can accurately calculate your constellation and zodiac, complete the birthday reminder of the lunar and solar calendars, support switching between two different display styles, and can set the background image of the homepage and the optional homepage module


Special feature:

【Life Left】 Calculate how long the current user has survived in the world and how much time is left based on the entered birthday. The warning statement on the card on the homepage reminds you to always cherish time;

【Life Train] Life is like a trip. Family and friends are like passengers on the train. They can accompany you for a while, but they will not accompany you for a lifetime. You can clearly see the progress of your family and friends' lives;

【Birthday】 Accurately calculate the user's zodiac and constellation. For users who are added to the birthday list, the system will send a reminder on the user's birthday to remind you not to miss TA's birthday;

【Wish】 You can add your wish list and set an end time. The system will notify you when the expiration time comes, reminding you to keep your wishes in mind and work hard to achieve them;

【Clock】 A simple desktop clock that can be opened when you are focused on work to remind you of the passage of time;

【Radio】 includes current broadcasts, as well as provincial broadcasts, foreign broadcasts and Internet broadcasts. It is a good helper for entertaining and learning English;

【Switch background】 There are dozens of beautiful pictures built in the system, you can choose the picture you like as the family background;

【Theme style】 The purple theme mode is a refreshing style, while retaining the dark dark green style of the old version, which can be switched according to your preferences;

【Card Alpha】 Support to modify the card double-sided of the home page module and birthday list;

【Honor】 Collect and organize according to users' comments and user names in the App Store;


Written at the end:
I wish everyone a long life while making good use of every second of the moment

